; Add these records under the tokencatalog.dev zone in DNS > Records.
; Cloudflare Name fields: _index._agents, _mcp._agents, _catalog._agents.
; SVCB priority is 1; target is tokencatalog.dev; paste the remaining fields
; into Values. The TXT Content field is the quoted text below, without quotes.
; TTL: 3600 seconds. Discovery records are DNS-only.
; Keep the website's proxied Tunnel CNAME separate. DNS names have no /md3 path;
; the discovery URLs carry the path. The numbered keys and mcp label are experimental.

_index._agents.tokencatalog.dev. 3600 IN SVCB 1 tokencatalog.dev. alpn="h2" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65400="https://tokencatalog.dev/.well-known/ai-catalog.json"
_mcp._agents.tokencatalog.dev. 3600 IN SVCB 1 tokencatalog.dev. alpn="mcp,h2" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65400="https://tokencatalog.dev/md3/mcp/server-card" key65402="mcp"
_catalog._agents.tokencatalog.dev. 3600 IN TXT "url=https://tokencatalog.dev/.well-known/ai-catalog.json"
